<title>PHILIPPINES: Union Bank 9-mth net at 725 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Union Bank 9-mth net at 725 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine Stock Exchange said on Tuesday net income of Union Bank of the Philippines in the first nine months of the year was up 27.6 percent at 725 million pesos.</p>
<p>&quot;The figures are based on papers submitted by the company here at the compliance department,&quot; an official of the exchange told Reuters.</p>
<p>No other details were available.</p>
<p>--Manila newsroom (632) 841-89-36, fax 817-62-67</p>
